            "heading_RCKixX": {
              "type": "heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<p>We don’t just create portraits; we preserve the precious souls of your four-legged family members. Every piece is a labor of love, crafted with meticulous attention to detail and a deep respect for the bond you share.</p>",
