    "1770630035327698cb": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_57dc8f0_7yqh4b": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_57dc8f0",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>What Our Pet Parents Say</p>",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "content_spacing": 24,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "image_border_radius": 12,
            "slide_1_text": "<p>I surprised my husband with this Royal Portrait of our 'King' for his birthday, and his reaction says it all! Our cat has always acted like he owns the house, so seeing him depicted as a literal King on such a high-quality canvas is just perfect.</p><p>The attention to detail is incredible, the way the artist blended his grumpy but noble expression into the regal uniform and crown is pure genius. The canvas itself is museum-grade and feels very sturdy.  Best purchase I've made all year!</p>",
            "slide_1_user_name": "Jennifer Miller",
            "slide_1_image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_600x600.5619775204_slaibu1z_1.avif",
            "slide_2_text": "<p>My daughter surprised me with this mug featuring my beloved Binky! It’s exactly as described and the artwork is just beautiful. Excellent service from the team as well—everything was smooth and fast. Such a meaningful gift that I'll use every day. Thank you, Painterful!</p>",
            "slide_2_user_name": "James Wilson",
            "slide_2_image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_600x600.5651763566_2a9uafmy_1.webp",
            "slide_3_text": "<p>It’s rare to find a professional who consistently delivers such excellence, but my second experience with Painterful was just as wonderful as the first. Their signature patience and kindness during the proofing process turned a stressful decision (choosing the perfect royal outfit!) into a collaborative breeze.</p><p>When I felt torn between photos, their genuine, thoughtful insight helped me move forward with confidence. The results are spectacular—the way they blended my cat’s features into the royal attire is perfectly balanced, authentic, and remarkably natural. Finding such high-level artistic skill paired with an honest, supportive approach is a real gem. I am thrilled with the outcome and will definitely be back for a third time! Thank you for making our holiday so special!</p>",
            "slide_3_user_name": "Emily Rodriguez",
            "slide_3_image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_600x600.6574691755_blr7b3qp_1.webp",
            "background_color": "#fbf7f2",
            "heading_color": "#3e2816",
            "text_color": "#3e2816",
            "quote_icon_color": "#be5737",
            "star_color": "#e8a531",
